ordering-review.json
O01 unclear A constructed Closed breaker accepts an Execute request → caller supplies a request → Execute runs the given request. 0.02
O03 unclear A request was sent before a count clear → it completes after the clear → its result does not affect the cleared Counts. 0.18
O04 unclear An idle Open breaker has no State, admission or completion calls → time is exactly at the timeout deadline → state changes autonomously and immediately to HalfOpen. 0.01
O05 unclear A breaker changes state with nonnil OnStateChange → state and counts are committed while the breaker holds its mutex → callback runs inside the same lock and returns before public calls can proceed. 0.01
